    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Survivors of childhood cancer will gather at Aga Khan University Hospital on March 9, to offer hope and encouragement to children still fighting the disease. The annual haematology/oncology party will be a day of fun activities and games for survivors and patients to enjoy in the company of their friends, families and the hospital staff.",
